Typed tests read the installed dependencies through `manifest.toml` in the
working directory, so run `gleam test` from the project root.

error[grice/cannot-read]: Can't read a file

grice couldn't read `manifest.toml`, which it needs to lint the project: No
such file or directory.

Hint: Check that it's there and that you can read it. Sources must be
UTF-8.

grice couldn't complete the run. Fix the problems above and run it again.

